// Real PICO PARK sprites, lifted from the game's own texture atlas.
//
// Provenance (recovered-data): src/engine/assets/picoAtlas.png is the 1024x1024
// TGA carved from the retail RAM dump at 0x4a1018 (recovered/tga_carved/
// tga_0002_0x4a1018.png), converted losslessly to PNG. Frame rects below come
// from connected-component analysis of that atlas (2026-07-02).
//
// The cat template is CHANNEL-KEYED by the game itself: body = pure (255,0,0),
// outline = pure (0,255 removed... (0,0,255)), accent/tongue = pure (0,255,0),
// face = black. Player colors are baked by remapping those keys — the same
// recolor scheme the engine uses. PLAYER_PALETTE is sampled from the atlas's
// own player-color swatch row, so the tints are the shipped ones, not guesses.
//
// Loading is OPTIONAL by design: loadPicoSpriteAtlas() is only called from the
// browser bootstrap. In headless tests (and any load failure) every getter
// returns undefined and actors keep their hand-drawn Graphics fallback.

